omnipresence wrote:
> After DYWYPI, the default answer in 3.3.1 is (y), [for inventory, conduct,
> etc] but in 3.4.1 the default answer is (n). I checked the defaults.nh file
> but i did not see anything governing how to change that aspect. Is there a
> simple quick fix answer to this dilemma?

The disclose option is what you want. Here's are sample discloses, the
one I think you'd want is first:

OPTIPNS=disclose:yiagcv
OPTIPNS=disclose:+iagcv
OPTIPNS=disclose:yina+g-cnv

y is "ask, default yes"
n is "ask, default no"
+ is "don't ask, yes"
- is "don't ask, no"

i is "display inventory"
a is "display attributes"
g is "display genocides"
c is "display conducts"
v is "display vanquished creatures"

If you don't mind me asking, why don't you play 3.4.3? :)

